      "A gerund is a verb used as a noun: *leaving, reading, washing*.",
      "-um- and -in verbs: **pag- + root** (pag-alís, pagbása).",
      "Mag- and -an verbs: **pag- + repeated first syllable + root** (paglalarô, paghuhugas).",
      "Paki- verbs: **paki + ki + root** (pakíkisúlat).",
      "Ma- verbs: **pag-** for actions (pagligò), **pagka-** for feelings (pagkagálit).",
      "Use **ang** (or **ang mga**) in front of the gerund."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "vocab",
     "group": "more",
     "title": "More words from this lesson"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
